rtcTraversablePointQuery \- traverses the BVH with a point query object
.EE
.SS SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
#include <embree4/rtcore.h>

void rtcTraversablePointQuery(
  RTCTraversable traversable,
  struct RTCPointQuery* query,
  struct RTCPointQueryContext* context,
  struct RTCPointQueryFunction* queryFunc,
  void* userPtr
);
.EE
.SS DESCRIPTION
The \f[CR]rtcTraversablePointQuery\f[R] function is equivalent to
\f[CR]rtcPointQuery\f[R] but takes a traversable object
(\f[CR]traversable\f[R] argument) instead of a scene object.
.PP
For more details, refer to the documentation of
\f[CR]rtcPointQuery\f[R].
